00:24:34.549 --> 00:24:37.218
every poison that's hindering you,

00:24:37.218 --> 00:24:39.685
every inflexibility that's stopping

00:24:39.685 --> 00:24:42.582
you from what God is about
to pour into your life.

00:24:42.582 --> 00:24:45.857
Woe be unto you if you
go into another year

00:24:45.857 --> 00:24:49.275
and waste another year
with the old mentality

00:24:49.275 --> 00:24:52.102
while somebody is in
the hospital begging God

00:24:52.102 --> 00:24:54.846
for the opportunity
that you have right now.

00:24:54.846 --> 00:24:57.596
You better step into this moment.

00:25:03.777 --> 00:25:04.826
Lay your hands on your head and say,

00:25:04.826 --> 00:25:07.159
give me a new mind.

00:25:07.159 --> 00:25:10.201
(audience chants)

00:25:10.201 --> 00:25:14.529
Give me a new mind means
give me a new perspective.

00:25:14.529 --> 00:25:16.813
Give me a new perspective,
give me a new way

00:25:16.813 --> 00:25:19.978
of looking at my situation,
give me a new way

00:25:19.978 --> 00:25:23.506
of looking at my
circumstances, get my mind

00:25:23.506 --> 00:25:26.793
ready for this year, because
when I get this year,

00:25:26.793 --> 00:25:30.558
there's going to be
blessings, there's going

00:25:30.558 --> 00:25:32.596
to be opportunities.

00:25:32.596 --> 00:25:34.231
Oh yes, there's going
to be some struggles,

00:25:34.231 --> 00:25:35.873
there's going to be some challenges,

00:25:35.873 --> 00:25:37.116
there's going to be some tests,

00:25:37.116 --> 00:25:39.033
but even the struggles are an opportunity

00:25:39.033 --> 00:25:42.561
for me to show off the victory if my mind

00:25:42.561 --> 00:25:44.620
can handle the change.

00:25:44.620 --> 00:25:47.141
You got what it takes.

00:25:47.141 --> 00:25:51.383
Storms coming, winds
blowing, lightning flashes,

00:25:51.383 --> 00:25:55.402
things aren't fair, things are upsetting,

00:25:55.402 --> 00:25:59.043
they're nervwracking, but the very fact

00:25:59.043 --> 00:26:01.543
that he allowed it to happen,

00:26:02.877 --> 00:26:05.426
seeing as he is the architect,

00:26:05.426 --> 00:26:09.204
it is a sign that he's
looked at the specs,

00:26:09.204 --> 00:26:11.444
he knows what he put in you,

00:26:11.444 --> 00:26:14.312
he knows his grace, he is sufficient

00:26:14.312 --> 00:26:16.906
to get you to this moment in your life,

00:26:16.906 --> 00:26:18.852
and somebody, oh, I'm about to feel

00:26:18.852 --> 00:26:20.403
like a preacher now.

00:26:20.403 --> 00:26:23.359
SOmebody in this room knows, you've been

00:26:23.359 --> 00:26:26.130
through some stuff that if anybody would

00:26:26.130 --> 00:26:28.625
have told you that you
had to deal with that,

00:26:28.625 --> 00:26:32.050
you'd have said ain't no
way I could handle it.

00:26:32.050 --> 00:26:35.075
But every time you got ready to give up,

00:26:35.075 --> 00:26:37.864
there's was something on the inside

00:26:37.864 --> 00:26:40.986
that kept telling you, go ahead,

00:26:40.986 --> 00:26:43.997
go ahead, go ahead.

00:26:43.997 --> 00:26:48.287
If you're in here today,
slap your neighbor and say,

00:26:48.287 --> 00:26:49.537
I'm still here.

00:26:51.365 --> 00:26:55.161
I've been tried, but I'm still here.

00:26:55.161 --> 00:26:58.592
I've been burdened, but I'm still here.

00:26:58.592 --> 00:27:02.119
I've been lonely, but I'm still here.

00:27:02.119 --> 00:27:05.537
I've been frustrated, but I'm still here.

00:27:05.537 --> 00:27:08.503
I cried, but I'm still here.

00:27:08.503 --> 00:27:12.197
Somebody, help me pray.

00:27:12.197 --> 00:27:15.197
(audience cheering)

00:27:16.940 --> 00:27:21.107
Hallelujah, hallelujah, hallelujah,

00:27:22.417 --> 00:27:24.139
hallelujah!

00:27:24.139 --> 00:27:26.504
High five your neighbor and say,

00:27:26.504 --> 00:27:28.337
you got what it takes.

00:27:29.751 --> 00:27:32.441
You will make it out of this storm,

00:27:32.441 --> 00:27:34.853
you will survive this riptide,

00:27:34.853 --> 00:27:37.962
you will get through
this stage in your life,

00:27:37.962 --> 00:27:39.712
you have God!

00:27:50.251 --> 00:27:54.418
Hallelujah, hallelujah, hallelujah!

00:27:55.832 --> 00:27:58.266
I don't know who I'm preaching to,

00:27:58.266 --> 00:28:01.025
but I know I'm preaching to somebody.

00:28:01.025 --> 00:28:03.434
The devil's been telling you, you're at

00:28:03.434 --> 00:28:06.011
your breaking point, but the devil

00:28:06.011 --> 00:28:07.941
is not your architect.

00:28:07.941 --> 00:28:11.204
He don't know what God put inside of you.

00:28:11.204 --> 00:28:15.364
Yeah, yeah!

00:28:15.364 --> 00:28:17.614
Ya'll going to come get me up!

00:28:22.650 --> 00:28:25.650
(screams excitedly)

